{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rensu-e-o218","title":"吏民啼泣遮道，车不得前，步步稽留，十余日乃出界","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-4b19cb34c1454357abda","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"吏民啼泣遮道，车不得前，步步稽留，十余日乃出界","evidence":["rensu-q-fcfae6686f5adf632854"]},{"id":"rensu-a-b2924fe500d336fe2c7f","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"颜斐东行至崤而疾困，临卒言我心不愿平原、何不言京兆，遂卒，还平原","evidence":["rensu-q-1bc7730f373718fdd782"]},{"id":"rensu-a-d1283a14099ba8fa3870","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"京兆闻颜斐卒皆流涕，为立碑，于今称颂之","evidence":["rensu-q-bc7c378afce31bea6bab"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0062","role":"离任者；疾困而卒者；受立碑称颂者","evidence":["rensu-q-fcfae6686f5adf632854","rensu-q-1bc7730f373718fdd782","rensu-q-bc7c378afce31bea6bab"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-fcfae6686f5adf632854","rensu-q-1bc7730f373718fdd782","rensu-q-bc7c378afce31bea6bab"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-fcfae6686f5adf632854","source_order":[16,375,494],"order":3467}],"persons":[{"id":"rensu-p0062","name":"颜斐","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-1bc7730f373718fdd782","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-6577b6fcf8117e2e08d7","layer":"pei","quote":"东行，至崤而疾困。斐素心恋京兆，其家人从者，见斐病甚，劝之，言：‘平原，当自勉励作健。’斐曰：‘我心不愿平原！汝曹等呼我，何不言京兆邪？’遂卒，还平原","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":518,"end":593,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-bc7c378afce31bea6bab","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-6577b6fcf8117e2e08d7","layer":"pei","quote":"京兆闻之，皆为流涕，为立碑，于今称颂之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad8